      "text": "Communication Pattern",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Communication Pattern",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "fS7KMrKdtKsI6pcEKgL6S",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -396.40810412930665,
      "y": 4725.863771483006,
      "width": 900.1390991210938,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#12b886",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aKS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 658841327,
      "version": 1266,
      "versionNonce": 246574273,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "mthwqWIsIIZJKaiExezna",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1776810859804,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Components (Microservices/Modules) communicate with each other in two ways,\nfor synchronous operations that require immediate response, the component calls \nthe other component's internal REST API endpoints.\n\nFor operations that could take a long time to finish (or at all), asynchronous communication\nis used in the form of publishing/subscribing to message queue.  ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Components (Microservices/Modules) communicate with each other in two ways,\nfor synchronous operations that require immediate response, the component calls \nthe other component's internal REST API endpoints.\n\nFor operations that could take a long time to finish (or at all), asynchronous communication\nis used in the form of publishing/subscribing to message queue.  ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ktXNQrMLuVdkdC5q2wtAc",
