      "updated": 1776810346007,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- POST /deployments -> Create new deployment\n- PATCH /deployments/:depid -> Make changes to the status of the deployment (e.g stopping the app) \n- GET /deployments\n- GET /deployments/:deppid\n- GET /deployments/latest -> Get the current application deployment, response includes exposed interface, status, \nmetadata, etc",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- POST /deployments -> Create new deployment\n- PATCH /deployments/:depid -> Make changes to the status of the deployment (e.g stopping the app) \n- GET /deployments\n- GET /deployments/:deppid\n- GET /deployments/latest -> Get the current application deployment, response includes exposed interface, status, \nmetadata, etc",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
