      "updated": 1776810934991,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "For example, deployment module might need to fetch metadata of an application\nwhen it receives a \"deployment_created\" message,\nand the deployment module then need to fetch host metadata from the\nprovisioning module to and the deployment module then need to fetch host\nmetadata from the provisioning module to configure the web server.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "For example, deployment module might need to fetch metadata of an application when it receives a \"deployment_created\" message,\nand the deployment module then need to fetch host metadata from the provisioning module to and the deployment module then need to fetch host metadata from the provisioning module to configure the web server.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
